<title>USA: Food Lion says starts $26/shr Kash n' Karry tender.</title>
<headline>Food Lion says starts $26/shr Kash n' Karry tender.</headline>
<dateline>SALISBURY, N.C. 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Food Lion Inc said Friday that it has begun its previously announced all-cash tender offer for all of the issued and outstanding common shares of Kash n' Karry at $26.00 per share.</p>
<p>The offer and withdrawal rights will expire on December 13.</p>
<p>Consummation of the merger between the two supermarket chains is expected to occur later this year or early next year. The merger transaction is valued at $341 million.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
